    {
      "direction": "input",
      "name": "payload",
      "type_desc": "dict",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "required": true,
      "default_value_repr": "",
      "constraints": "Exact version-1 dict containing populations, background and short-noise banks, inference, epochs, batch_size, seed and initialization. Exactly four fourfold and five fivefold training/validation splits; unique nonempty record keys within each population and disjoint keys within each split. Finite nonempty mono arrays explicitly sampled at 32000 Hz; primary and distinct secondary class indices in 0..263. Training requires a primary label; empty-label validation records are permitted. Nonempty noise banks, each waveform at least 3200 samples with finite positive float32 RMS. Inference contains only sample_rate and waveform. At least two epochs, positive even batch size at least two with a complete training batch per fold, bounded integer seed, and explicit synthetic or provisioned_backbone initialization. Caller owns consistent units, label meaning, fold membership and population independence; no audio decoding, resampling or automatic duplicate detection."
    },
    {
      "direction": "output",
      "name": "result",
      "type_desc": "dict",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "required": true,
      "default_value_repr": "",
      "constraints": "Finite Python dict containing models_completed=13, seventeen training-phase summaries including four continuations, integer window_votes and boolean window_decisions for each five-second interval and 264 output slots, plus 264 whole_record_decisions. Clip and frame threshold is fixed at 0.3; four of thirteen model votes select a window. Whole-record decisions require four already-selected windows. Final partial windows are allowed; padding and endpoints are excluded by half-open intervals. Singleton and empty events are supported. Training summaries report selected epoch and validation score; they are not unbiased performance estimates or calibrated probabilities. No named submission formatting or persisted reusable model is returned."
    }
  ]
